%% Portfolio evidence only: conceptual firmware flow; not an exact trace of the delivered implementation.
%% The root src/main.cpp is the only firmware source and is redacted/non-buildable; the independent host example is the runnable code sample.
flowchart TD
    A[Power On] --> B[Initialize Controller]
    B --> C[Load Supported Settings]
    C --> D[Initialize Ethernet and Display]
    D --> E[Start RTOS Tasks]
    E --> F[Network Task Receives Request]
    E -. development path .-> U[UART Command Input]
    U -.-> G[Validate and Interpret Command]
    F --> G[Validate and Interpret Command]
    G --> H[Update One Display Line or Supported State]
    H --> I[Display Task Renders State]
    I --> J[Display Refresh Continues]
